{"zh":[{"start":0.1,"end":4.22,"text":"旁白：2017 年 8 月 21 日，"},{"start":4.24,"end":8.42,"text":"一次日食将经过美国全部 50 个州。"},{"start":8.44,"end":14.26,"text":"这会让美国大部分地区一睹月亮"},{"start":14.26,"end":21.12,"text":"滑到太阳和地球之间、把影子投到我们身上的情景。"},{"start":21.15,"end":25.17,"text":"你在哪里，看到的景象就不一样。"},{"start":25.19,"end":29.32,"text":"如果你在全食带上，会看到月亮完全挡住太阳。"},{"start":29.34,"end":33.51,"text":"如果你在全食带之外，会看到月亮经过，"},{"start":33.53,"end":37.71,"text":"但太阳永远不会被完全遮住。"},{"start":37.73,"end":41.75,"text":"不管你在哪里，都绝不要在没有防护的情况下直视太阳，"},{"start":41.77,"end":45.9,"text":"比如日食眼镜（不是太阳镜）。"},{"start":45.92,"end":50.02,"text":"唯一的例外是你能看到全食的时候。"},{"start":50.04,"end":56.1,"text":"只有当月亮完全挡住太阳时，你才能安全地直接看日食。"},{"start":56.1,"end":59.46,"text":"在那一刻之前和之后，都要保护好眼睛。"},{"start":60.8,"end":62.92,"text":"这样的天象很罕见。"},{"start":63.92,"end":70.4,"text":"上一次横贯美国东西海岸的日全食是在 1918 年，"},{"start":70.4,"end":78.38,"text":"下一次在美国本土的日全食要到 2024 年。"},{"start":78.38,"end":83.42,"text":"别错过这次亲眼看日食的机会！更多信息见 eclipse2017.nasa.gov"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.1,"end":4.22,"text":"Narrator: On August 21, 2017,","words":[["Narrator:","旁白"],["On","在"],["August","八月"],["21,","21"],["2017,","2017年"]]},{"start":4.24,"end":8.42,"text":"a solar eclipse will pass over all 50 United States.","words":[["a","一次"],["solar","日"],["eclipse","食"],["will","将"],["pass","经过"],["over","越过"],["all","全部"],["50","50"],["United","合众"],["States.","国"]]},{"start":8.44,"end":14.26,"text":"This will afford most of the country a glimpse of what it is like to have the moon","words":[["This","这"],["will","将"],["afford","给予"],["most","大部分"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["country","国家"],["a","一"],["glimpse","瞥"],["of","的"],["what","什么"],["it","它"],["is","是"],["like","像"],["to","去"],["have","有"],["the","这"],["moon","月亮"]]},{"start":14.26,"end":21.12,"text":"slide between the sun and the Earth casting a shadow on us down below.","words":[["slide","滑"],["between","在…之间"],["the","这"],["sun","太阳"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["Earth","地球"],["casting","投下"],["a","一个"],["shadow","影子"],["on","在"],["us","我们"],["down","向"],["below.","下面"]]},{"start":21.15,"end":25.17,"text":"The experience will look different depending on where you are located.","words":[["The","这"],["experience","体验"],["will","将"],["look","看起来"],["different","不同"],["depending","取决于"],["on","于"],["where","哪里"],["you","你"],["are","是"],["located.","位于"]]},{"start":25.19,"end":29.32,"text":"If you are along the path of totality, you see the moon fully block the sun.","words":[["If","如果"],["you","你"],["are","是"],["along","沿着"],["the","这"],["path","路径"],["of","的"],["totality,","全食"],["you","你"],["see","看到"],["the","这"],["moon","月亮"],["fully","完全"],["block","挡住"],["the","这"],["sun.","太阳"]]},{"start":29.34,"end":33.51,"text":"If you are outside of the path, you will see the moon go by,","words":[["If","如果"],["you","你"],["are","是"],["outside","外面"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["path,","路径"],["you","你"],["will","将"],["see","看到"],["the","这"],["moon","月亮"],["go","经过"],["by,",""]]},{"start":33.53,"end":37.71,"text":"but the sun will never be fully covered.","words":[["but","但"],["the","这"],["sun","太阳"],["will","将"],["never","永不"],["be","是"],["fully","完全"],["covered.","遮住"]]},{"start":37.73,"end":41.75,"text":"Wherever you are, you never want to look directly at the sun without protection,","words":[["Wherever","无论哪里"],["you","你"],["are,","是"],["you","你"],["never","永不"],["want","想"],["to","去"],["look","看"],["directly","直接"],["at","在"],["the","这"],["sun","太阳"],["without","没有"],["protection,","防护"]]},{"start":41.77,"end":45.9,"text":"like eclipse glasses (not sunglasses).","words":[["like","像"],["eclipse","日食"],["glasses","眼镜"],["(not","（不是"],["sunglasses).","太阳镜）"]]},{"start":45.92,"end":50.02,"text":"The one exception is if you are able to see totality.","words":[["The","这"],["one","唯一"],["exception","例外"],["is","是"],["if","如果"],["you","你"],["are","是"],["able","能够"],["to","去"],["see","看到"],["totality.","全食"]]},{"start":50.04,"end":56.1,"text":"Only when the moon has fully blocked the sun, you are safe to look at the eclipse directly.","words":[["Only","只有"],["when","当"],["the","这"],["moon","月亮"],["has","已"],["fully","完全"],["blocked","挡住"],["the","这"],["sun,","太阳"],["you","你"],["are","是"],["safe","安全"],["to","去"],["look","看"],["at","在"],["the","这"],["eclipse","日食"],["directly.","直接"]]},{"start":56.1,"end":59.46,"text":"Before and after that moment, keep your eyes protected.","words":[["Before","之前"],["and","和"],["after","之后"],["that","那"],["moment,","时刻"],["keep","保持"],["your","你的"],["eyes","眼睛"],["protected.","受保护"]]},{"start":60.8,"end":62.92,"text":"Events like this are rare.","words":[["Events","事件"],["like","像"],["this","这"],["are","是"],["rare.","罕见"]]},{"start":63.92,"end":70.4,"text":"The last total solar eclipse to cross the U.S. coast-to-coast was in 1918,","words":[["The","这"],["last","上一次"],["total","全"],["solar","日"],["eclipse","食"],["to","去"],["cross","横越"],["the","这"],["U.S.","美国"],["coast-to-coast","海岸到海岸"],["was","是"],["in","在"],["1918,","1918年"]]},{"start":70.4,"end":78.38,"text":"and the next total solar eclipse in the continental U.S. isn’t until 2024.","words":[["and","而"],["the","这"],["next","下一次"],["total","全"],["solar","日"],["eclipse","食"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["continental","本土"],["U.S.","美国"],["isn’t","不是"],["until","直到"],["2024.","2024年"]]},{"start":78.38,"end":83.42,"text":"Don’t miss this opportunity to experience a solar eclipse! Learn more at eclipse2017.nasa.gov","words":[["Don’t","别"],["miss","错过"],["this","这"],["opportunity","机会"],["to","去"],["experience","体验"],["a","一次"],["solar","日"],["eclipse!","食"],["Learn","了解"],["more","更多"],["at","在"],["eclipse2017.nasa.gov","网址"]]}]}